the SaveData is a set.
this's Path is a text.

the Game is an actor.
this's State is a SaveData.

this can Save.
this's Save does...
    if this's State exists?
        this is Saved with this's State!
    or?
        this is failed with error "no state"!

the App is a script.

Game's State is a SaveData with Path "/p".

do Game's Save...
    if that is Saved?
        log "saved".
        log that's Path.
    or?
        log "failed".
        log that's error.
